/*---
esid: pending
description: RegExp.$1-$9 throw a TypeError for cross-realm receiver
info: |
  get RegExp.$1-$9

  1. Return ? GetLegacyRegExpStaticProperty(%RegExp%, this value, [[RegExpParen1-9]]).

  GetLegacyRegExpStaticProperty( C, thisValue, internalSlotName ).

